                <pb facs="0714" n="634" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg634"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 12.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Smith to Mr.
                            Powell</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Gonaives notified <hi rendition="#italic">Paloma</hi> blockade Cape. Proceeded,
                    but seized upon by <hi rendition="#italic">Crête</hi>. Had to exclude Cape.
                    Proceeded Cayes. File protest. Return Port au Prince Saturday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
